  (20852,'Diri na ba liwat hira maagi dinhi?','Will they not now pass by here again? [or] Will they also not now pass by here?'),
  (20853,'Waray ka na ba gihapon lumaba ha mga bado nira Terry ngan Leo?','Have you(sing) not already washed Terry and Leo''s shirts again? [or] Did you(sing) also not already wash Terry and Leo''s shirts?'),
  (20854,'Waray na liwat maupod hi Jane kan Luz.','Jane did not go with Luz again. [or] Jane also did not go with Luz.'),
  (20855,'Diri pa liwat maluto an aton kabulig.','Our(incl) helper will not yet cook again.'),
  (20856,'Waray pa ba gihapon umuli adton nga mga bata?','Have those(far) children also not returned home yet? [or] Have those(far) children still not returned home again?'),
  (20857,'Diri na ba liwat mawali iton pastor?','Will that pastor not now preach again? [or] Will that pastor also not now preach?'),
  (20858,'Waray pa ba masunod inin tawo ha panday?','Did this man not yet follow the carpenter? [or] Did this man still not follow the carpenter?'),
  (20859,'Diri na ba matan-aw an mga estudyante hin sine?','Will the students not watch a movie now?'),
  (20860,'Waray ba gihapon sumuroy an mga maestra ha Victoria Plaza?','Did the teachers not roam around at Victoria Plaza again?'),
  (20861,'Waray na pod mauyon an mga mag-uroma ha presidente.','The farmers also have not already agreed with the president.'),
  (20862,'Diri pa liwat mahatag an akon lolo hin kwarta.','My grandfather will still not give money again. [or] My grandfather also will not yet give money.'),
  (20863,'Waray pa pumalit an kuripot nga lalake hin sapatos.','The stingy man has still not bought shoes. [or] The stingy man has not yet bought shoes.'),
  (20864,'Waray hiya makaon...','He did not eat...'),
  (20865,'Waray na hiya makaon...','He did not eat already...'),
  (20866,'Waray pa hiya makaon...','He has not yet eaten...'),
  (20867,'Waray na liwat hiya makaon...','He did not eat again already...'),
  (20868,'Waray ba hiya makaon?','Did he not eat?'),
  (20869,'Waray na ba hiya makaon?','Has he not eaten already?'),
  (20870,'Waray pa ba hiya makaon?','Has he not yet eaten?'),
  (20871,'Waray ba liwat hiya makaon?','Did he not eat again?'),
  (20872,'Waray pa ba liwat hiya makaon?','Has he not yet eaten again?'),
  (20873,'Diri ko paliton hiton.','I will not buy it.(hiton)'),
  (20874,'Diri ko na paliton hiton.','I will not buy it now.'),
  (20875,'Diri ko pa paliton hiton.','I will not buy it yet.'),
  (20876,'Diri ko liwat paliton hiton.','I will also not buy it.'),
  (20877,'Diri ko na liwat paliton hiton.','I will also not now buy it.'),
  (20878,'Diri ko pa liwat paliton hiton.','I will also not yet buy it.'),
  (20879,'Diri ba hira maawit?','Will they not sing?(-awit)'),
  (20880,'Diri na ba hira maawit?','Will they not sing now?'),
  (20881,'Diri pa ba hira maawit?','Will they still not sing?'),
  (20882,'Diri ba liwat hira maawit?','Will they also not sing?'),
  (20883,'Diri na ba liwat hira maawit?','Are they also not now going to sing?'),
  (20884,'Diri pa ba liwat hira maawit?','Are they not yet going to sing again?'),
  (20885,'Waray uminom inin bata.','This child did not drink.'),
  (20886,'Waray na uminom inin bata.','This child did not already drink.'),
  (20887,'Waray pa uminom inin bata.','This child did not yet drink.'),
  (20888,'Waray liwat uminom inin bata.','This child also did not drink.'),
  (20889,'Waray na liwat uminom inin bata.','This child also did not already drink.'),
  (20890,'Waray pa liwat uminom inin bata.','This child still did not drink again.'),
  (20891,'Diri madalagan an aton estudyante.','Our(incl) student will not run.'),
  (20892,'Diri na madalagan an akon sakyanan.','My vehicle will not run now.'),
  (20893,'Diri pa madalagan an iya grupo.','His/Her group will not yet run.'),
  (20894,'Diri na liwat mabulig iton nga abogado.','That lawyer will not help again now.'),
  (20895,'Diri na liwat mabulig ini nga doktor.','This doctor will not help again now.'),
  (20896,'Diri pa liwat mabulig adton tigulang.','That old person will not yet help again.'),
  (20897,'Waray mamulay hi Bebot.','Bebot did not play.'),
  (20898,'Waray ba mamulay hi Bebot?','Did Bebot not play?'),
  (20899,'Waray ba liwat mamulay hi Bebot?','Did Bebot not play again?'),
  (20900,'Waray na ba mamulay hi Bebot?','Did Bebot not play already?'),
  (20901,'Waray pa ba masuba hi Inday hin isda?','Has Inday not yet fetched fish?'),
  (20902,'Waray na ba liwat masuba hi Inday hin bulad?','Has Inday not already fetched dried fish again?'),
  (20903,'Waray pa ba liwat masuba hi Inday hin karne?','Has Inday not yet fetched meat again?'),
  (20904,'Waray na hiya mapasaylo ha iya kabulig.','He will no longer forgive his helper.'),
  (20905,'Diri na liwat maupod hi Bong kan Janice.','Bong will not join Janice again.'),
  (20906,'Waray pa maabot adton tawo.','That person has not arrived yet.'),
  (20907,'Diri na ba liwat mabasa an akon anak?','Will my child not read again?'),
  (20908,'Waray pa ba liwat makanta hi Mike?','Has Mike not sung again yet?'),
  (20909,'Waray ka na liwat makahabilo ha mga miyembro.','You have not been able to convince the members again.'),
  (20910,'Diri pa ba liwat kamo makita ha telebisyon?','Will you (plural) not be seen on television again yet?'),
  (20911,'Waray pa ba liwat umuli an imo lola?','Has your(sing) grandmother also still not gone home?'),
  (20912,'Diri ka pa ba liwat masul-ot han imo bag-o nga bado?','Will you(sing) still not wear your(sing) new shirt?'),
  (20913,'Waray na ba liwat makadagan hi Lydia?','Has Lydia not already run again?'),
  (20914,'Diri na liwat hira makadaog han sweepstakes.','They will now not win the sweepstakes again.'),
  (20915,'Waray pa liwat umukoy an mga maestra ha amon balay.','The teachers also have still not moved to our(excl) house.'),
  (20916,'Diri pa ba liwat mahatag hi Rose hin kwarta ha ira?','Will Rose also still not give money to them?'),
  (20917,'Waray ka pa ba umadto didto?','Have you still not gone there?'),
  (20918,'Diri na liwat mag-ampo an akon bugto.','My brother will now not pray again.'),
  (20919,'Nagdara liwat an abugado hin mangga para ha iya pamilya.','The lawyer brought mango again for his family.'),
  (20920,'Magbantay pa hiya ha balay nira ni Rhoda ngan Romulo.','He will still guard Rhoda and Romulo''s house.'),
  (20921,'Pagtrabaho na ha uma ni Tacio didto ha bukid.','Work now on Tacio''s farm there(far) in the mountain.'),
  (20922,'Nagmamando hi Jesus ha iya mga tinun-an.','Jesus is commanding his disciples.'),
  (20923,'Mag-aram pa ba hira hin Tagalog ha Manila?','Will they still learn Tagalog in Manila?'),
  (20924,'Nagsiring hi Jesus Kristo, "Ako an dalan, an kamatuoran, ngan an kinabuhi."','Jesus Christ said, "I am the way, the truth, and the life."'),
  (20925,'Paglirong ha imo kaugaringon.','Deny yourself.'),
  (20926,'Mag-andam an Ginoo hin lugar para ha aton didto ha langit.','The Lord will prepare a place for us(incl) there(far) in heaven.'),
  (20927,'Nag-asawa na hira hi Rolly ngan Mae ha Matina Baptist Church.','Rolly and Mae already got married at Matina Baptist Church.'),
  (20928,'Magkinahanglan pa hira hin bag-o nga uniporme ha ira eskwelahan.','They will still need a new uniform at their school.'),
  (20929,'Mag-computer ako.','I will use the computer.'),
  (20930,'Nag-t.v. kami.','We(excl) are watching t.v.'),
  (20931,'Mag-guitar hi Josh.','Josh will play the guitar.'),
  (20932,'Nag-C.R. an mga bata.','The children used the C.R.'),
  (20933,'Pagpiano!','Play the piano!'),
  (20934,'Nagbabado hi Erin.','Erin is wearing a dress.'),
  (20935,'Magkape kita.','We(incl) will drink coffee.'),
  (20936,'Pagbus paingon ha Mati.','Ride the bus going to Mati.'),
  (20937,'Nagdyaket an maestra.','The teacher wore a jacket.'),
  (20938,'Nag-aadobo hi Gener.','Gener is cooking adobo.'),
  (20939,'Nag-ukoy na an akon maestra ha siyudad.','My teacher already lives in the city.'),
  (20940,'Nag-aaram pa liwat hira hi Kir ngan Kathy ha Waray.','Kir and Kathy are still learning Waray again.'),
  (20941,'Paghulat pa ha imo pag-umangkon.','Wait for your nephew/niece.'),
  (20942,'Magkinahanglan pa ba kita hin tambal para ha mga bata?','Will we still need medicine for the children?'),
  (20943,'Nagkita an mag-uroma ngan mangingisda ha baybayon.','The farmer and the fisherman met at the beach.'),
  (20944,'Magtelepono hi Bebing kan Suzie.','Bebing will telephone Suzie.'),
  (20945,'Pagsaruwal pakadto ha uma.','Wear pants going to the farm.'),
  (20946,'Nagkakape na ba an mga bisita didto ha karenderiya?','Are the guests already drinking coffee there at the eatery?'),
  (20947,'Pag-awto na pakadto ha merkado.','Take the car now (going) to the market. [verbalized noun]'),
  (20948,'Nagpipiano hiya ha singbahan liwat.','She is playing the piano at the church again. [verbalized noun]'),
  (20949,'Nagmiting an mga opisyales han baryo.','The officers of the barrio had a meeting. [verbalized noun]'),
  (20950,'Nagtatrabaho na hi John para ha gobyerno.','John now works for the government.'),
  (20951,'Nagbabantay liwat an amon ayam han amon balay.','Our(excl) dog also guards our(excl) house.'),
  (20952,'Pag-asawa na kan Bobong.','Marry Bobong now.'),
  (20953,'Mag-aandam liwat an anak han karpintero hin pagkaon para ha ira amyaw.','The carpenter''s son will again prepare food for their neighbor.'),
  (20954,'Waray pa hira masimba.','They have not yet worshipped.'),
  (20955,'Diri na hira masimba.','They will not worship now.'),
  (20956,'Magdara ako han iyo lamesa ha iyo balay.','I will bring your table in your house.'),
  (20957,'Nagdadara ako han iyo lamesa ha iyo balay.','I am bringing your table in your house.'),
  (20958,'Nagdara ako han iyo lamesa ha iyo balay.','I brought your table in your house.'),
  (20959,'Pagdara han iyo lamesa ha iyo balay.','Bring your table in your house.'),
  (20960,'Nagkinahanglan liwat kami hin pastor ha amon iglesiya.','We also needed a pastor in our church.'),
  (20961,'Pag-aram na hin bag-o nga mga kamatuoran ha Biblia.','Learn now new truths in the Bible.'),
  (20962,'Nagdadara an mga mangirisda hin mga isda ha merkado.','The fishermen are bringing fish to the market.'),
  (20963,'Nagsiring an Biblia, "Pag-andam na ha imo mga kaugalingon."','The Bible says, "Prepare yourselves now."'),
  (20964,'Magrelepono an silingan ha iya nga sangkay didto ha opisina.','The neighbor will call his friend at the office.'),
  (20965,'Paghulat ha baybayon kan Gilda ngan Perla.','Wait at the beach for Gilda and Perla.'),
  (20966,'Nagdadara hi Jane ngan hi Lori hin tambal ha ospital.','Jane and Lori are bringing medicine to the hospital.'),
  (20967,'Nagsarangbot hi Ronel kan Bing-bing ha simbahan, ngan yana magpapakasal hira.','Ronel met Bing-bing at church, and now they will marry.'),
  (20968,'Nag-uukoy ako ha balay han akon suod nga sangkay.','I am living at the house of my close friend.'),
  (20969,'Nagsakay hira ha ira awto pakadto ha kabukiran kada udto.','They rode in their car going to the mountains every noon.'),
  (20970,'Waray pa ako mag-andam hin mensahe. [past]','I have not yet prepared a message.'),
  (20971,'Diri liwat hiya magtukar ha sista ha simbahan. [future]','He will not play the guitar again at the church.'),
  (20972,'Waray ka pa ba magplite hin balay? [past]','Have you still not rented a house?'),
  (20973,'Diri na hira mag-aalagad ha Ginoo. [future]','They will not serve the Lord now.'),
  (20974,'Waray ka pa liwat magsurat ha iyo Ninong. [past]','You(pl) have also still not written to your godparent.'),
  (20975,'Diri gihapon mag-aantos hi Jesu Kristo didto ha krus.','Jesus will not suffer again there(far) on the cross.'),
  (20976,'Waray mag-ihaw iton nga tawo hin karabaw.','That man did not kill the carabao.'),
  (20977,'Diri maghihimo hi Almer ha iya mga buruhaton.','Almer will not do his work.'),
  (20978,'Waray pa mag-ampo an diyakono ha serbisyo.','The deacon has not yet prayed in the service.'),
  (20979,'Diri na magtitikang an maestro ha iya nga klase.','The teacher will not start his class now.'),
  (20980,'Ayaw pag-aram hin maraot nga mga butang.','Don''t learn bad things.'),
  (20981,'Ayaw pag-andam hin paniudto.','Don''t prepare lunch.'),
  (20982,'Ayaw kamo paglirong kan Jesu Kristo.','Do not deny Jesus Christ. (plural)'),
  (20983,'Ayaw na kamo pag-alagad ha iyo mga santos.','Do not serve your(pl) saints now.'),
  (20984,'Ayaw kamo pagpatay.','Do not kill. (Thou shall not kill.)'),
  (20985,'Nag-uukoy na ba hira Edgar ngan Luz ha ira bag-o nga balay?','Are Edgar and Luz already living in their new house?'),
  (20986,'Magkikinahanglan ka ba hin bulig?','Will you need help?'),
  (20987,'Nagtukar pa ba liwat an imo anak han sista?','Did your child play the guitar again?'),
  (20988,'Naghimo na ba kamo hin kwarto para ha iyo kabulig?','Have you already made a room for your helper?'),
  (20989,'Nag-antos pa ba adto nga pasyente didto ha ospital?','Is that patient still suffering there in the hospital?'),
  (20990,'Nagtratrabaho ba liwat iton nga estudyante ha imo tanoman?','Is that student also working in your garden?'),
  (20991,'Nag-alagad na ba hira hadto nga simbahan didto ha probinsiya?','Have they already served in that church there in the province?'),
  (20992,'Mag-piplite ba gihapon hi Henry hin dyip?','Will Henry still rent a jeep?'),
  (20993,'aaram','Make an Ayaw command using this verb.'),
  (20994,'tikang','Make an Ayaw command using this verb.'),
  (20995,'dara','Make an Ayaw command using this verb.'),
  (20996,'surat','Make an Ayaw command using this verb.'),
  (20997,'1. Nag-ühaw na ba liwat hi Jon hin baboy?','1. Has Jon slaughtered a pig again?'),
  (20998,'2. Magdadara ba kamo hin pagkaon para ha iyo pangiklop?','2. Will you (pl) bring food for your supper?'),
  (20999,'3. Nagsiring na ba an Pulong ha Dios ha imo?','3. Has the Word of God spoken to you?'),
  (21000,'4. Magdadalagan ka pa ba ha bukid?','4. Will you still run to the mountain?'),
  (21001,'5. Nag-asawa na ba liwat iton nga lalake ha iba nga babaye?','5. Has that man married another woman again?'),
  (21002,'6. Ayaw bantayi an akon awto.','6. Don''t guard my car.'),
  (21003,'7. Ayaw rentahi iton nga balay didto yana.','7. Don''t rent that house "over there" now.'),
  (21004,'8. Ayaw paghimo hin idolo.','8. Do not make an idol.'),
  (21005,'9. Ayaw pagtrabaho didto nga lugar.','9. Don''t work at that place.'),
  (21006,'10. Ayaw teleponohi an eskwelahan.','10. Do not telephone the school.'),
  (21007,'Karuyag ko hin tubig.','I would like some water.'),
  (21008,'Karuyag nimo?','Do you (sing) want to?'),
  (21009,'Nakaruyag hiya kan Inday.','He likes Inday.'),
  (21010,'Ako la an magbuot hiton.','I will be the one to decide that.'),
  (21011,'Nagkinahanglan ako hin bulig.','I need help.'),
  (21012,'Pwede ba kamo?','Can you (pl)?'),
  (21013,'Mahimo ba?','Is it possible? (or) Can it be?'),
  (21014,'1. Karuyag hiya magpalit hin sapalos.','1. He wants to buy shoes.'),
  (21015,'2. Buot magmulay an mga bata.','2. The children wish to play.'),
  (21016,'3. Kinahanglan kita magtrabaho.','3. We (incl) must work. / We (incl) need to work.'),
  (21017,'4. Pwede magkadto hi Felix ha iyo.','4. Felix can go to your (house). / Felix will be able to go to your house.'),
  (21018,'5. Mahimo kami magtrabaho buwas.','5. We (excl) will be able to work tomorrow.'),
  (21019,'1. Karuyag ako magpalit hin karne ha merkado [or] Karuyag magpalit ako hin karne ha merkado.','1. I want to buy meat at the market.'),
  (21020,'2. Buot hiya maglakat ha siyudad [or] Buot maglakat hiya ha siyudad.','2. She wants to go to the city.'),
  (21021,'3. Karuyag hi Debbie magbisita ha iya tiya. [or] Karuyag magbisita hi Debbie ha iya tiya.','3. Debbie wishes to visit her aunt.'),
  (21022,'4. Buot an mga bata magkaon hin sorbeti. [or] Buot magkaon an mga bata hin sorbeti.','4. The children would like to eat ice cream.'),
  (21023,'5. Karuyag iton nga tawo mag-alagad ha Dios. [or] Karuyag mag-alagad iton nga tawo ha Dios.','5. That man wishes to serve God.'),
  (21024,'1. Kinahanglan ako magtrabaho. [or] Kinahanglan magtrabaho ako.','1. I must work.'),
  (21025,'2. Kinahanglan ka magluto hin manok. [or] Kinahanglan magluto ka hin manok.','2. You (sing) need to cook a chicken.'),
  (21026,'3. Kinahanglan nga hi Jose magsimba. [or] Kinahanglan magsimba hi Jose.','3. Jose needs to go to church.'),
  (21027,'4. Kinahanglan ini nga mga bata mag-eskwela. [or] Kinahanglan mag-eskwela ini nga mga bata.','4. These children must go to school.'),
  (21028,'1. Pwede hira magbantay ha iyo balay. [or] Pwede magbantay hira ha iyo balay.','1. They can watch your (pl) house.'),
  (21029,'2. Mahimo ba kamo maghulat ha amon? [or] Mahimo ba maghulat kamo ha amon?','2. Would it be possible for you (pl) to wait for us (excl)?'),
  (21030,'3. Pwede ka ba magdara hin asukar? [or] Pwede ba magdara ka hin asukar?','3. Would you be able to bring sugar?'),
  (21031,'4. Mahimo hi Felix magtukar hin sista. [or] Mahimo magtukar hi Felix hin sista.','4. Felix may play the guitar.'),
  (21032,'5. Pwede adto nga panday magbuhat hin bodega. [or] Pwede magbuhat adto nga panday hin bodega.','5. That carpenter "over there" can make a warehouse.'),
  (21033,'6. Mahimo ako maupod ha imo. [or] Mahimo maupod ako ha imo.','6. I will be able to go with you.'),
  (21034,'1. Karuyag hira mag-ampo para ha mga masakiton.','1. They want to pray for the sick.'),
  (21035,'2. Karuyag mag-inom hi Pastor Tan hin luy-a.','2. Pastor Tan wants to drink ginger.'),
  (21036,'3. Karuyag an amon mga kabulig nga mag-uli ha ira.','3. Our helpers want to return to them.'),
  (21037,'4. Buot hi Randy magpakyaw hin dyip.','4. Randy wants to contract a jeep.'),
  (21038,'5. Buot ba kamo magkompesal han iyo mga sala?','5. Do you (pl) want to confess your sins?'),
  (21039,'6. Kinahanglan magsangyaw kita nga tanan han Pulong ha Ginoo.','6. We all need to preach the Word of the Lord.'),
  (21040,'7. Kinahanglan hi Paul maghimo hin bag-o nga saad ha Dios.','7. Paul needs to make a new promise to God.'),
  (21041,'8. Kinahanglan nga an mga opisyales han iglesiya magtukdaw.','8. The church officials must stand up.'),
  (21042,'9. Pwede ka ba magtutdo ha amon hin mga karantahon?','9. Can you (sing) teach us (excl) songs?'),
  (21043,'10. Pwede mag-ukoy hira Rey ngan Jun dinhi ha amon.','10. Rey and Jun can live here with us (excl).'),
  (21044,'11. Pwede magsakay kamo hin sarakyan didto.','11. You (pl) can ride a vehicle there.'),
  (21045,'12. Mahimo mabaton ako hiton nga pakiana.','12. I will be able to answer that question.'),
  (21046,'13. Mahimo ba an mga ninong ngan ninang mapalit hin litson para ha amon kasal?','13. Will the godfathers and godmothers be able to buy lechon for our wedding?'),
  (21047,'14. Karuyag ko karawaton hi Jesus Kristo.','14. I would like to receive Jesus Christ.'),
  (21048,'15. Karuyag hi Mike ngan hi Kristi mag-aram hin Tagalog.','15. Mike and Kristi want to learn Tagalog.'),
  (21049,'16. Kinahanglan kita magtikang hin singbahan didto ha iton nga kaamyaw.','16. We (incl) need to start a church there in that neighborhood.'),
  (21050,'17. Kinahanglan kamo magtalikod ha iyo kalugaringon.','17. You (pl) must deny yourselves.'),
  (21051,'18. Mahimo ba an mga magturutdo magpreparar hin merienda?','18. Would it be possible for the teachers to prepare a snack?'),
  (21052,'19. Pwede hiya makigkita ha iya mga sangkay ha kolehiyo.','19. She can meet her friends at the college.'),
  (21053,'20. Oo, mahimo hi Pam magbantay han iyo mga anak.','20. Yes, Pam will be able to watch your (pl) kids.'),
  (21054,'21. Buot an iya anak magbalik ha singbahan.','21. His son wishes to come back to the church.'),
  (21055,'22. Kinahanglan ka magtalikod ha imo daan nga kinabuhi.','22. You (sing) must turn away from your old life.'),
  (21056,'23. Karuyag hi Lance magsangyaw ha Waray.','23. Lance wants to preach in Waray.'),
  (21057,'24. Karuyag an pastor magpahibaro hin importante nga mga butang ha aton.','24. The pastor wants to announce (some) important things to us (incl).'),
  (21058,'25. Pwede na hi Esther mag-asawa han iya uyab.','25. Esther can now marry her boyfriend.'),
  (21059,'Kinahanglan magbalik hi Abner ha iya pamilya.','Abner needs to return to his family.'),
  (21060,'Buot an anak ni Sarah magsangyaw hini nga kaharani.','Sarah''s child wants to preach in this neighborhood.'),
  (21061,'Mahimo pa ba ako magkompesal?','Can I still confess?'),
  (21062,'Karyyag hira magsakay hin karabaw.','They want to ride a carabao.'),
  (21063,'Pwede ka ba magpahibaro ha iyo nga simbahan?','Can you inform your church?'),
  (21064,'Mahimo ni Reynaldo ito para ha akon.','Reynaldo can make that for me.'),
  (21065,'Buot ba kamo maglibot-libot upod ha akon?','Do you(pl) want to roam around with me?'),
  (21066,'Kinahanglan ka uminom hin damo nga tubig dinhi ha Pilipinas.','You(sing) need to drink much water here in the Philippines.'),
  (21067,'Mahimo ni Bit-bit magluto hin panihapon.','Bit-bit will be able to cook supper.'),
  (21068,'Buot han bugto ni Ashley sumarig kan Jesus.','Ashley''s sister wants to trust Jesus.'),
  (21069,'Ano an imo ngaran?','What is your name?'),
  (21070,'Ano man ini ha Waray?','What is this in Waray?'),
  (21071,'Ano an "pencil" ha Waray?','What is "pencil" in Waray?'),
  (21072,'Ano an imo trabaho?','What is your work?'),
  (21073,'Q: Ano man ini?
